    <description>Direct debit mandate request via the invoice email: payments of this invoice that wait for the invoice email (Interaction Status 'Awaiting Invoice Email', set by afl_Payment_Direct_Debit_Setup) move on once the package decided on the email. SENT: the request reached the customer with the invoice → 'Mail Sent' (reminders start). ERROR / WILL_NOT_BE_SENT: send the separate setup email after all, clear the invoice block → 'Mail Sent'.</description>
